  "notes": [
    "Preserves historical eight native nodes, innate ranks, native XP curve and two seven-rank paid pilot values; no new prices. Names are presentation placeholders.",
    "Normal Gilded and Golden Dragon diet are distinct. Old ordinary Nether/gold foods and actual lava-catch provenance are retained only for verified non-dragon/non-lich. Golden Dragon requires verified cave species and exact golden fruit/vegetable tag; modded enchanted carrot and alcohol IDs still need registry survey. Lich physiology precedence and eligibility/hybrid integration require provider reconciliation. Unknown provider flags do not qualify these condition examples.",
    "Alcohol uses explicit pending tag; no changes to normal intoxication. Ore and lava fishing practice are opt-in activities; no global fishing ban. Actual lava fishing permission and final receipt behavior need pinned provider inspection.",
    "Pending block/entity loot tags deliberately absent, and hybrid claw/breath effects deliberately not emitted; confirm conditional gold-tool/weapon permission and native DS claw/breath source. No runtime promotion; ordinary path and skill scope need full review. No Netherite weapons looting. Source food bonuses use actual positive delta, no second potion application.",
    "Gold weapon/armor changes are player-scoped native equivalence with original numerical values. Harvest extension is limited to correct golden pickaxe and known vanilla requirements. Native and crafted items retain original NBT."
  ],
